# MET-13: copy this file to batch1_idats.path and replace the line below with the
# absolute path to the batch1 IDAT directory on your system. The real .path files
# are gitignored -- their entire content was an internal cluster path and this repo
# is public. Setting BATCH1_IDAT_DIR in the environment bypasses this file entirely.
#
# batch1: the durable data-warehouse copy -- numbered sentrix directories only, no
# GenomeStudio folder, so targets' format="file" hashes it cleanly.
/replace/with/absolute/path/to/batch1/idats
